<title>英伟达称其Groq 3 LPX比Cerebras快四倍，但实际情况更为复杂</title>
<link>https://the-decoder.com/nvidia-says-its-groq-3-lpx-is-four-times-faster-than-cerebras-but-the-math-is-more-complicated/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://the-decoder.com/?p=39412</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 12:27:57 +0000</pubDate>
<source>the-decoder.com</source>
<description><![CDATA[【the-decoder.com】英伟达正将其Groq 3 LPX推理芯片投入全面生产，并报告在Gemma 4 31B上每秒处理3400个令牌，速度是Cerebras的四倍。但这些数字并未完全反映事实。据The Register报道，英伟达要达到这一性能至少需要64个加速器，而Cerebras仅需一两个。该架构在大型MoE模型上的扩展性如何，仍是一个未解之谜。文章《英伟达称其Groq 3 LPX比Cerebras快四倍，但实际情况更为复杂》首发于The Decoder。<br/><br/><a href="https://the-decoder.com/nvidia-says-its-groq-3-lpx-is-four-times-faster-than-cerebras-but-the-math-is-more-complicated/">阅读原文</a>]]></description>
</item>
